{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13208","headline":"送归中丞使新罗 · 皇甫冉","name":"送归中丞使新罗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"诏使殊方远，朝仪旧典行。\n浮天无尽处，望日计前程。\n暂喜孤山出，长愁积水平。\n野风飘叠鼓，海雨湿危旌。\n异俗知文敎，通儒有令名。\n还将大戴礼，方外授诸生。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13208.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13208","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}